<!--
Here lies the mission contacts for each neighborhood and organization

Without further ado - the fields:

id - this is a unique number for each contact. Make it one more than the last one
org - ID number of the organization to which this contact belongs (see above)
		OR zero (0) if it's a neighborhood contact
name - the string that Missile will show in a list of contacts
name-id - the stringtable id (in stringtable_client.sta) of the localized name of this contact
code - procedural text stringtable abbreviation
face - client resource ID of the image to show as their face

Only for org contacts:
min-rep - The player must have at least this much reputation to get this contact
max-rep - If the player has more than this reputation, the contact retires, 0 means never.
-->
